{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/register-a-uk-establishment-of-an-overseas-company-os-in01","content_id":"5f1c7029-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Use this form to register a UK establishment of an overseas company.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9135708","isbn":"","title":"How to complete your OS IN01","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/register-a-uk-establishment-of-an-overseas-company-os-in01/how-to-complete-your-os-in01"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"enquiries@companieshouse.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69691471cbe2202b38424864","filename":"OS_IN01_v10.0-FINAL.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":642143,"filename":"OS_IN01_v10.0-FINAL.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9135709","isbn":"","number_of_pages":16,"title":"OS IN01 registration of an overseas company opening a UK establishment","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69691471cbe2202b38424864/OS_IN01_v10.0-FINAL.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"enquiries@companieshouse.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"696a04f81c8a70fc0a3b0451","filename":"OS_IN01_continuation_pages.zip"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/zip","file_size":375280,"filename":"OS_IN01_continuation_pages.zip","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9135710","isbn":"","title":"OS IN01 continuation pages (optional)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/696a04f81c8a70fc0a3b0451/OS_IN01_continuation_pages.zip"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Read <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/register-a-uk-establishment-of-an-overseas-company-os-in01/how-to-complete-your-os-in01\">how to complete form OS IN01</a> before you submit your form.</p>\n\n<p>It costs £124 to register a UK establishment of an overseas company.</p>\n\n<p>For more information on overseas companies, read our <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/overseas-companies-in-the-uk-registration-filing-and-disclosure-obligations\">overseas companies guidance</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"before-you-register\">Before you register</h2>\n\n<p>All directors will need to verify their identity to prove who they are. You’ll need to give the Companies House personal code for each director and confirm they have verified their identity.</p>\n\n<p>See <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/verifying-your-identity-for-companies-house\">Verifying your identity for Companies House</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"nationalities-and-countries\">Nationalities and countries</h2>\n\n<p>Use our <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nationalities\">list of nationalities and countries</a> to complete your form. We’ll only accept entries from this standard list.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Updated fee to register a UK establishment of an overseas company.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-16T11:51:13Z"},{"note":"Fee updated.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-01T00:01:08Z"},{"note":"Updated in line with changes to company registers and the launch of mandatory identity verification.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-18T00:01:04Z"},{"note":"Fee updated.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-30T23:00:04Z"},{"note":"Added guidance on how to complete your OS IN01. ","public_timestamp":"2021-10-21T09:56:37Z"},{"note":"Form updated following end of Brexit transition.","public_timestamp":"2020-12-31T23:00:27Z"},{"note":"Guidance added for changes from 1 January 2021.","public_timestamp":"2020-01-31T11:37:43Z"},{"note":"Link added to nationalities and countries list.","public_timestamp":"2018-02-09T11:09:00Z